  "body": "A rare opportunity to secure a comfortable two-bedroom home in one of Takapuna’s most central, vibrant, and convenient locations.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the ultimate coastal lifestyle with everything you need right at your doorstep. Take a short stroll to Shore City Shopping Centre, New World or Woolworths supermarket, Takapuna Library, the local cinema, and live entertainment at the Bruce Mason Centre or the Pump House Theater. \r\n\r\nStay active at Les Mills, Jetts, ALLFIT, explore boutique cafes and restaurants, or relax at Takapuna Beach. Water sports enthusiasts can head straight to nearby Lake Pupuke for world-class kayaking, stand-up paddleboarding, and windsurfing.\r\n\r\nTop-Tier Schooling\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned for families, this property is surrounded by highly sought-after school zones and premier educational institutions, including:\r\n\r\n• Takapuna Primary School & Takapuna Normal Intermediate\r\n• Westlake Girls High School & Takapuna Grammar School\r\n• St Joseph’s Catholic School\r\n• Rosmini College & Carmel College\r\n• Practical Comfort & Convenience\r\n\r\n\r\nWith easy motorway access, commuting is effortless and efficient. The home itself is practical and well-appointed, featuring 2 bedrooms and 1 bathroom, along with excellent parking and storage options, including a spacious storage area.\r\n\r\nEmbrace the convenience and exceptional amenities that surround you.",
